deploy | info: webcam example

+ option board   | required: yes
+ option sculpt  | required: yes
+ option managed | required: yes

+ child internal | ram: 64M | pkg: video_bridge
  + provides
    + capture
    + gui

+ child internal_webcam | ram: 64M | pkg: usb_webcam
  + connect
    + gui | + child internal
    + usb | + child usb

+ child external | ram: 64M | pkg: video_bridge
  + provides
    + capture
    + gui

+ child external_webcam | ram: 64M | pkg: usb_webcam
  + connect
    + gui | + child external
    + usb | + child usb
-
